{"ID":"20240205164746-jr56xgh","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205164746-jr56xgh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164746-jr56xgh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111200-pndfjdp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611091448-fmxhcj4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240621112657-qvpl4s3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"126桑螵蛸","type":"doc","updated":"20240811165142"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206111200-pndfjdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111200-pndfjdp","updated":"20240206111215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】\t螳螂科昆虫大刀螂Tenodera sinensis Saussure、小刀螂Statilia maculata "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"("}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Thunberg"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":")"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 或巨斧螳螂Hierodula patellifera "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"("}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Serville"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":")"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的干燥卵鞘。以上三种分别习称“团螵蛸”、“长螵蛸”及“黑螵蛸”。深秋至次春采收，除去杂质，蒸至虫卵死后，干燥。\n【产地】\t全国大部分地区均产。\n【性状】\t团螵蛸：略呈圆柱形或半圆形，由多层膜状薄片叠成，长2.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4cm，宽2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3cm。表面浅黄褐色，上面带状隆起不明显，底面平坦或有凹沟。体轻，质松而韧，横断面可见外层为海绵状，内层为许多放射状排列的小室，室内各有一细小椭圆形卵，深棕色，有光泽。气微腥，味淡或微咸。\n长螵蛸：略呈长条形，一端较细，长2.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5cm，宽1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.5cm。表面灰黄色，上面带状隆起明显，带的两侧各有一条暗棕色浅沟及斜向纹理。质硬而脆。\n黑螵蛸：略呈平行四边形，长2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4cm，宽1.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2cm。表面灰褐色，上面带状隆起明显，两侧有斜向纹理，近尾端微向上翘。质硬而韧。\n【性味】\t甘、咸，平。\n【功效】\t益肾固精，缩尿，止浊。用于遗精滑精，遗尿尿频，小便白浊。"}]},{"ID":"20240206111159-z2j065j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111159-z2j065j","updated":"20240811164208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206111159-lo728g9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165345-twhnvvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165345-twhnvvz","updated":"20240811164214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑螵蛸"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑螵蛸-20240205165345-rmscroz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240811164916-b0ojauw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240811164916-b0ojauw","updated":"20240811164916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 631px;","style":"width: 621px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑螵蛸 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑螵蛸 1-20240811164417-elea3qo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 621px;\" parent-style=\"width: 631px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 633px;","style":"width: 623px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑螵蛸 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑螵蛸 4-20240811164843-xusloj6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 623px;\" parent-style=\"width: 633px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240811164921-bnbx6ya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240811164921-bnbx6ya","updated":"20240811164922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 633px;","style":"width: 623px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑螵蛸 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑螵蛸 3-20240811164802-akx3qsh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 623px;\" parent-style=\"width: 633px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 632px;","style":"width: 622px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑螵蛸 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑螵蛸 2-20240811164651-fi0ccy0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 622px;\" parent-style=\"width: 632px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240621112627-prueyoz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621112627-prueyoz","updated":"20240811164333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 563px;","style":"width: 553px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621112627-uyibhrm.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 553px;\" parent-style=\"width: 563px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 705px;","style":"width: 695px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑螵蛸"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑螵蛸-20240811164333-1vh6uzb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 695px;\" parent-style=\"width: 705px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240811165029-4rukaux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240811165029-4rukaux","updated":"20240811165142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 661px;","style":"width: 651px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"螳螂 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/螳螂 1-20240811165142-fp5ub9u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 651px;\" parent-style=\"width: 661px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 589px;","style":"width: 579px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"螳螂"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/螳螂-20240811165029-tpzlhwp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 579px;\" parent-style=\"width: 589px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240621112547-m8igswa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621112547-m8igswa","updated":"20240621112614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：桑螵蛸即螳螂的卵。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091438-toeoiho","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091438-toeoiho"}},{"ID":"20240611092138-7vacz7g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611092138-7vacz7g","updated":"20240611092145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611092138-wx0fzlu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092138-wx0fzlu","updated":"20240611092138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸甘，平，无毒。主伤中，疝瘕，阴痿，益精生子，女子血闭，腰痛，通五淋，利小便水道。又疗男子虚损，五脏气微，梦寐失精，遗溺。久服益气养神。一名蚀疣，生桑枝上，螳螂子也。二月三月采蒸之，当火炙，不尔令人泻。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092124-4i3x5yi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611092124-4i3x5yi"}},{"ID":"20240611092126-zp29flt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611092126-zp29flt","updated":"20240611092130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611092126-nfc0owb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092126-nfc0owb","updated":"20240611092126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、甘，平，无毒。主伤中，疝瘕，阴痿，益精，生子，疗女子血闭，腰痛，通五淋，利小便水道。又疗男子虚损，五脏气微，梦寐失精，遗溺。久服益气，养神。一名蚀疣。生桑枝上，螳螂子也，二月、三月采蒸之，当火炙，不尔令人泄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092126-v3t7rda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092126-v3t7rda","updated":"20240611092126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得龙骨，疗泄精，畏旋复花。俗呼螳螂为 螂，逢树便产，以桑上者为好，是兼得桑皮之津气。市人恐非真，皆令合枝断取之尔，伪者亦以胶着桑枝之上也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091438-vbxmqcz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091438-vbxmqcz"}},{"ID":"20240611092112-msr8g6u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611092112-msr8g6u","updated":"20240611092118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611092112-eniecav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092112-eniecav","updated":"20240611092112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸平。主伤中。疝瘕阴痿。益精生子。女子血闭。腰痛五淋。利小便水道。一名蚀。生桑枝上。采蒸之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092112-alsi1u4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092112-alsi1u4","updated":"20240611092112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巨伟维桑。蛰虫依固。细中藏。乳蛆外附。绡状轻飘。房看分注。蚕稠梅黄。骧首齐骛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092112-e6n0s5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092112-e6n0s5v","updated":"20240611092112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"傅咸赋。以厥树之巨伟。诗。维桑与梓。礼。蛰虫始振。汉书传。易可依固。诗疏。螟蛉。俗谓之桑。色青而细小。李时珍曰。螳螂骧首奋臂。深秋乳子如蛆。粘着树枝。其状轻飘如绡。重重有隔房。后汉书传。羽翼外附。庾信铭。八溪分注。礼。仲夏之月螳螂生。李白诗。五月梅始黄。蚕稠桑柘空。温庭筠诗。班马方齐骛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092008-cssss6a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611092008-cssss6a"}},{"ID":"20240611092102-g15v86e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611092102-g15v86e","updated":"20240611092107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《中药炮制》"}]},{"ID":"20240611092102-hfx6l1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092102-hfx6l1l","updated":"20240611092102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『来源』本品为螳螂科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大刀螂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"巨斧螳螂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的干燥卵鞘。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092102-eebjqhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092102-eebjqhu","updated":"20240611092102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『常用名』螳螂子。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092102-t2ethk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092102-t2ethk0","updated":"20240611092102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『产地』湖北、湖南、江西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092102-r65vzhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092102-r65vzhf","updated":"20240611092102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『采收季节』春秋季采集。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092102-u3kkt7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092102-u3kkt7k","updated":"20240611092102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『炮制方法』鲜品或干品，放入蒸笼内蒸上汽，取出，晒干或烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092102-eylk2vx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092102-eylk2vx","updated":"20240611092102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『用量』3～9克。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092102-0z51f6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092102-0z51f6n","updated":"20240611092102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『贮存』装木箱加盖，防潮及虫蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092051-onkc3u2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611092051-onkc3u2"}},{"ID":"20240611092053-q7wt5ul","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611092053-q7wt5ul","updated":"20240611092057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"螳螂桑螵蛸《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611092053-irxeerx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092053-irxeerx","updated":"20240611092053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」刀螂，拒斧、不过。其子房名螵蛸、蝉蛸、致神、野狐鼻涕。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092053-6u0r26n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092053-6u0r26n","updated":"20240611092053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（桑螵蛸）咸、甘、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092053-h1bl2lb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092053-h1bl2lb","updated":"20240611092053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240611092053-7lzwzpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092053-7lzwzpl","updated":"20240611092053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、遗精白浊，盗汗虚劳。用桑螵蛸（炙）、白龙骨，等分为末。每服二钱，空心服，盐汤磅送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092053-7vzb1gl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092053-7vzb1gl","updated":"20240611092053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、小便不通。用桑螵蛸（炙黄）三十枚、黄芩二两，水煎，分二次服下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092053-7ecztcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092053-7ecztcs","updated":"20240611092053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、妊娠遗尿不禁。用桑螵蛸十二枚。研为末，分二次服，米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092053-0253av3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092053-0253av3","updated":"20240611092053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、咽喉肿塞。用桑上螳螂窠一两，烧灰。马屁勃半两，研匀，加蜜做成丸子，如梧子大。每服三、五丸，煎犀角汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092008-qtth91s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611092008-qtth91s"}},{"ID":"20240611092027-l8ii5x8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611092027-l8ii5x8","updated":"20240611092032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611092027-l4kpxur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092027-l4kpxur","updated":"20240611092027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘咸平．入足少阴太阳厥阴经．功专固涩．治小儿夜尿及惊风良．得龙骨疗泄精．得茯神远志菖蒲人参当归龙骨鳖甲治健忘心神不安．以螳螂一个．巴豆半粒．研敷箭簇伤处极痒．痒极乃撼拔之．以黄连贯众汤洗去．再以锻石敷之．其伤即瘥．炙黄或醋煮汤泡煨用．或蒸透再焙．畏旋复花．"}]},{"ID":"20240611092008-h3siptz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611092008-h3siptz"}},{"ID":"20240611092017-2wjyr82","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611092017-2wjyr82","updated":"20240611092021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611092017-n7s9u3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092017-n7s9u3r","updated":"20240611092017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"螳螂深秋乳子作房。粘着桑枝上。即螵蛸也。长寸许。大如拇指。其内重重有隔。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092017-tjhs7w1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092017-tjhs7w1","updated":"20240611092017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每房有子如蛆卵。至芒种后齐出。（濒湖）二三月方可收采。（贞白）味咸甘。气平。气薄味浓。阴也。入足少阴太阳经。肝肾命门药也。（濒湖）本经治伤中疝瘕精。或权）古方恍惚甲之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611092017-y88jkss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092017-y88jkss","updated":"20240611092017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"劳盗汗桑螵蛸辅之味螵蛸十更可五丸〔论〕桑螵蛸深秋乳子。固蛰于房。交芒种乃奋出。其生在大火成功之后。其出当大火秉辛相辛以命门又用能行能固。适如乎精专之气而已。但行止补泻。必酌于他味以主之耳。其气味虽咸平。走肾而利水道。然得秋时收敛之气。凡失精遗溺火气太盛者。宜少少用之。（仲淳）〔辨治〕必以结桑枝上者为良。桑乃水星之精。是物禀金气。由母趋子气。故精专也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091801-69kfhr7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091801-69kfhr7"}},{"ID":"20240611092001-yj0scc4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611092001-yj0scc4","updated":"20240611092006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611092001-ikwypcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611092001-ikwypcz","updated":"20240611092001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘咸平，入肝肾命门，益精气固肾，治虚损遗浊阴痿，通淋缩小便，用桑树上者，若生非桑树以桑皮佐之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091934-677s1r2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091934-677s1r2"}},{"ID":"20240611091947-e3pj9sk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091947-e3pj9sk","updated":"20240611091955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091947-drstl91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091947-drstl91","updated":"20240611091947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘咸平无毒。桑枝上螳螂子也，火炙黄用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091947-3h960st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091947-3h960st","updated":"20240611091947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主伤中疝瘕、阴痿，益精生子，女子月闭腰痛，通五淋，利小便水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091947-hl68u5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091947-hl68u5v","updated":"20240611091947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸，肝肾命门药也，功专收涩。故男子虚损，肾衰阳痿，梦中失精，遗溺白浊方多用之。《本经》又言通五淋，利小便水道，盖取以泄下焦虚滞也。桑螵蛸散治小便频数，如稠米泔，心神恍惚，瘦悴食少。得之女劳者，方用桑螵蛸、远志、龙骨、菖蒲、人参、茯苓、当归、龟甲各一两，卧时人参汤调下二钱，如无桑树上者，以他树上者浓煎桑白皮汁佐之。若阴虚多火人误用反助虚阳，多致溲赤，茎痛，强中失精，不可不知；生研烂涂之出箭镞。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091934-d496el7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091934-d496el7"}},{"ID":"20240611091935-sul77mc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091935-sul77mc","updated":"20240611091941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091935-7r1166x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091935-7r1166x","updated":"20240611091935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸平无毒．和血强阴．固摄疗遗．益精壮肾．（桑螵蛸即螳螂子．一名赖尿郎．以桑树上者为佳．甘咸平无毒．入肾经血分．益肾固精．是其本功．故凡小儿肾气不足．夜多遗尿者．每每炙研服之．赖尿郎之名．即此之意．性能行血活血．故内服又能治女子血闭淋沥．外敷可消痈肿痔漏也．本经又称其利小便．似与固小便之说相反．或者亦如车前子之固者固其精气．利者利其邪水耳．然一物总不能兼两用．学人再当详考可也．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091902-uyw5prh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091902-uyw5prh"}},{"ID":"20240611091923-qykj1uu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091923-qykj1uu","updated":"20240611091929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091923-3res3we","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091923-3res3we","updated":"20240611091923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自采者真，市中所售者，恐不得尽皆桑中者。《蜀本·图经》浸泡之法，不若略蒸过为佳。邻家有一男子，小便日数十次，如稠米泔，色亦白，心神恍惚，瘦瘁，食减，以女劳得之。令服此桑螵蛸散，未终一剂而愈。安神魂，定心志，治健忘、小便数，补心气。桑螵蛸、远志、菖蒲、龙骨、人参、茯神、当归、龟甲醋炙，以上各一两，为末。夜卧，人参汤调下二钱。如无桑上者，即用余者，仍须以炙桑白皮佐之，量多少可也。盖桑白皮行水，意以接螵蛸就肾经。用桑螵蛸之意如此，然治男女虚损，益精，阴痿，梦失精，遗溺，疝瘕，小便白浊，肾衰，不可阙也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091903-oavjgm5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091903-oavjgm5"}},{"ID":"20240611091915-4a4qe3e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091915-4a4qe3e","updated":"20240611091919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《玉楸药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091915-4bsxzjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091915-4bsxzjp","updated":"20240611091915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，气平，入足少阴肾、足太阳膀胱、足厥阴肝经。起痿壮阳，回精失溺。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091915-7km1pn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091915-7km1pn8","updated":"20240611091915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸温暖肝肾，疏通膀胱，治遗精失溺、经闭阳痿、带浊淋漓、耳痛喉痹、瘕疝骨鲠之类皆效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091915-ltr8c0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091915-ltr8c0g","updated":"20240611091915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮，研细用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091821-bt87e3t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091821-bt87e3t"}},{"ID":"20240611091855-gxywxfz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091855-gxywxfz","updated":"20240611091900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《神农本草经百种录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091855-dmaooq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091855-dmaooq8","updated":"20240611091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸平。主伤中疝瘕，瘀血凝结中焦。阴痿，益精生子，补益肾气。女子血闭，和通血脉。腰痛，强肾之经。通五淋，利小便水道。通肾之府。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091855-co1lymd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091855-co1lymd","updated":"20240611091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸，桑上螳螂所生之子也。螳螂于诸虫中最有力，而其子最繁，则其肾之强可知。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091855-jblgn9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091855-jblgn9l","updated":"20240611091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人之有子，皆本于肾，以子补肾，气相从也。桑性最能续伤和血，螵蛸在桑者，得桑之性，故有养血逐瘀之功。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091844-obhhdn9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091844-obhhdn9"}},{"ID":"20240611091845-rc18c6s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091845-rc18c6s","updated":"20240611091849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091845-oq1wip2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091845-oq1wip2","updated":"20240611091845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、甘，平，无毒。主治伤中，疝瘕，阴痿，益精，生子，女子血闭，腰痛，通五淋，利小便水道。又治男子虚损，五脏气微，梦寐失精，遗溺。久服益气，养神。一名蚀 。生桑枝上，螳螂子也，二月、三月采蒸之，当火炙，不尔令人泄。得龙骨，治泄精。（畏旋复花。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091845-w5sg5j3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091845-w5sg5j3","updated":"20240611091845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"世呼螳螂为 螂，逢树便产，以桑上者为好，是兼得桑皮之津气，市人恐非真，皆令合枝?"}]},{"ID":"20240611091821-k7hihm5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091821-k7hihm5"}},{"ID":"20240611091828-qyb473f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091828-qyb473f","updated":"20240611091834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091828-7tt3v0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091828-7tt3v0h","updated":"20240611091828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补肾．"}]},{"ID":"20240611091828-l33vs44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091828-l33vs44","updated":"20240611091828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘咸平．入肝肾命门．益精气而固肾．治虚损阴痿．梦遗白浊．血崩腰痛．伤中疝瘕．（肝肾不足．）通五淋．缩小便．（能通故能缩、肾与膀胱相表里、肾得所养、气化则能出、肾气既固、则水道安常、故又能缩也、寇宗 治便数、有桑螵蛸散、桑螵蛸、茯神、远志、菖蒲、人参、当归、龙骨、鳖甲等分为末、卧时、人参汤下二钱、能补心安神、亦治健忘．）炙饲小儿．止夜尿．螳螂卵也．须用桑树上者．（一生九十九子、用一枚、即伤百命、仁人君子闻之、且当惨然、况忍食乎．房长寸许、有子如蛆、芒种后齐出、故月令、仲夏螳螂生也、如用他树者、以桑皮佐之、桑皮善行水、能引达肾经．）炙黄．或醋煮．汤泡煨用．或蒸透再焙．畏旋复花．螳螂能出箭簇．（螳螂一个、巴豆半个、研敷伤处、微痒且忍、极痒乃撼拔之、以黄连贯众汤洗、锻石敷之、杨氏方用螳螂出簇后、敷生肌散．）又治惊风．（古方治风、多用螵蛸、螳螂治风、同一理也．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091801-nig2qda","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091801-nig2qda"}},{"ID":"20240611091806-4va7m1q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091806-4va7m1q","updated":"20240611091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091806-afqor47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091806-afqor47","updated":"20240611091806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味咸、平。主伤中，疝瘕，阴痿，益精生子，女子血闭腰痛，通五淋，利小便水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091806-3wn0lgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091806-3wn0lgd","updated":"20240611091806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈修园曰∶螵蛸，螳螂之子也。气平属金，味咸属水。螳螂于诸虫中，其性最刚；以其具金性，能使肺之治节申其权，故主疝瘕，女子血闭、通五淋、利水道也。又具水性，能使肾之作强得其用，故主阴痿、益精生子、腰痛也。其主伤中者，以其生于桑上，得桑气而能续伤也。今人专取其缩小便，虽曰能开而亦能阖，然要其本性，在此而不在彼。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091438-vfwlw8e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091438-vfwlw8e"}},{"ID":"20240611091753-ivoriyc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091753-ivoriyc","updated":"20240611091758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091753-u6j9rcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091753-u6j9rcd","updated":"20240611091753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、甘，气平。无毒。系螳螂所生，逢荆棘俱有。独取桑树者入药，欲得桑津气引经。（桑皮善行水，故能引达肾经，如不得真者，加桑白皮佐之。）二三月中，方可收采。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091753-wyon0dq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091753-wyon0dq","updated":"20240611091753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曝干复炙，（当中破开炙之。）免泄大肠。畏旋覆花，宜白龙骨。主女人血闭腰痛，治男子虚损肾衰。益精强阴，补中除疝。止精泄而愈白浊，通淋闭以利小便。又禁小便自遗，故《本经》注云∶凡梦遗方中，不可缺也。俗谓禁尿窠，亦指此焉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091738-mto42uu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091738-mto42uu"}},{"ID":"20240611091739-o7avs9h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091739-o7avs9h","updated":"20240611091747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091739-cupp3o2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091739-cupp3o2","updated":"20240611091739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、甘，平，无毒。主伤中，疝瘕，阴痿，益精生子，女子血闭腰痛，通五淋，利小便水道。又疗男子虚损，五脏气微，梦寐失精，遗溺。久服益气养神。一名蚀 （音尤）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091739-o4c8p0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091739-o4c8p0a","updated":"20240611091739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生桑枝上，螳螂子也。二月、三月采蒸之，当火炙。不尔，令人泄。（得龙骨，疗泄精。畏旋复花。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091739-adv4prz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091739-adv4prz","updated":"20240611091739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶俗呼螳螂为 （音石）螂，逢树便产，以桑上者为好，是兼得桑皮之津气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091739-r2tlgzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091739-r2tlgzg","updated":"20240611091739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"市人恐非真，皆令合枝断取之尔，伪者亦以胶着桑枝之上也。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶此物多在小桑树上，丛荆棘间，并螳螂卵也，三月、四月中，一枝出小螳螂数百枚。以热浆水浸之一伏时，焙干，于柳木灰中炮令黄色用之。药性论云∶桑螵蛸，臣，畏戴椹。主男子肾衰，漏精，精自出。患虚冷者能止之，止小便利。火炮令热，空心食之。虚而小便利，加而用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091739-c5s1qdy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091739-c5s1qdy","updated":"20240611091739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经云桑螵蛸，螳螂子也。《本经》不载所出州土，今在处有之。螳螂逢木便产，一枚出子百数，多在小木荆棘间，桑上者兼得桑皮之津气，故以为佳。而市之货者，多非真。须连枝折之为验。然伪者亦能以胶着桑枝上，入药不宜也。三月、四月采。蒸过收之，亦火炙，不尔则令人泄。一法∶采得便以热浆水浸一伏时，焙干，更于柳木灰中，炮令黄用之。《尔雅》云∶莫貉（户各切），螳螂蛑。郭璞云∶螗螂，有斧虫，江东呼为石螂。又云∶不过，（丁郎切） （息详切）。 螳螂别名也。其子蜱（音裨）蛸（音萧），一名 （普莫切）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091739-9fg4crb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091739-9fg4crb","updated":"20240611091739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（音焦）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091739-ei2f2cz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091739-ei2f2cz","updated":"20240611091739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"， 卵也。古今方∶漏精及主风药中，多用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091739-phsso3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091739-phsso3s","updated":"20240611091739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，勿用诸杂树上生者，螺螺不入药中用。凡采觅须桑树东畔枝上者，采得去核子治底半字螵蛸十二枚，捣为散，分作两服，米饮下。《杨氏产乳》同。又方∶疗小便不通及胞转。桑螵蛸捣末，米饮服方寸匕，日三。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091739-d195ni9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091739-d195ni9","updated":"20240611091739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶桑螵蛸，自采者真，市中所售者，恐不得尽皆桑上者。《蜀本·图经》浸炮之法，不若略蒸过为佳。邻家有一男子，小便日数十次，如稠米泔色，亦白，心神恍惚，瘦瘁食减，以女劳得之。今服此桑螵蛸散，未终一剂而愈。安神魂，定心忐，治健忘，小便数，补心气。桑螵蛸、远志、菖蒲、龙骨、人参、茯神、当归、龟甲醋炙，以上各一两，为末。夜卧，人参汤调下二钱，如无桑上者，即用余者，仍须以炙桑白皮佐之，量多少，可也。盖桑白皮行水，意以接螵蛸就肾经。用桑螵蛸之意如此，然治男女虚损，益精，阴痿，梦失精，遗溺，疝瘕，小便白浊，肾衰不可阙也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091709-ctp7ir3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091709-ctp7ir3"}},{"ID":"20240611091720-d8two5o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091720-d8two5o","updated":"20240611091726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091720-kwayise","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091720-kwayise","updated":"20240611091720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补肾"}]},{"ID":"20240611091720-b4qautu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091720-b4qautu","updated":"20240611091720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘咸。入肝、肾、命门，益精气而固肾。治虚损阴痿，梦遗白浊，血崩腰痛，伤中疝瘕（肝肾不足），通五淋，缩小便（能通故能缩。肾与膀胱相表里，肾得所养，气化则能出，故能通；肾气既固，则水道安常，故又能止也。寇宗 治便数，有桑螵蛸散，桑螵蛸、茯神、远志、菖蒲、人参、当归、龙骨、鳖甲醋炙，各一两，为末。卧时，人参汤下二钱，能补心安神，亦治健忘）。炙，饲小儿，止夜尿。螳螂卵也。桑树产者为好（房长寸许，有子如蛆，芒种后齐出，故仲夏螳螂生也。如用他树者，以桑皮佐之，桑皮善行水，能引达肾经）。炙黄，或醋煮汤泡，煨用。畏旋复花（螳螂能出箭镞，螳螂一个，巴豆半个，研敷伤处。微痒且忍，极痒乃撼拔之。以黄连贯众汤洗，锻石敷之。《杨氏方》∶用蜣螂，镞出后，敷生肌散。螳螂、蜣螂，皆治惊风，今人罕用。蜣螂兼治腹痛、便秘、下痢、脱肛、疮疽、虫痔）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091709-fr0tgob","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091709-fr0tgob"}},{"ID":"20240611091710-95qltdt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091710-95qltdt","updated":"20240611091714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091710-49ou9x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091710-49ou9x2","updated":"20240611091710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即桑树上螳螂子也。一生九千九子，用一枚，便伤百命，勿轻用之。禀秋金之阴气，得桑上之津液，味甘咸，气平无毒，气薄味浓，阴也，入足少阴，太阳经，盖人以肾为根本，男子肾经虚损，则五脏气微，或阴痿，梦寐失精遗尿，咸味属水，内合于肾，肾得之而阴气生长，故能愈诸疾及益精生子也。肾与膀胱为表里，肾得所养，则膀胱自固，气化则能出，故利水通淋也。女子属阴，肝肾用事，疝瘕血闭腰痛，皆二经为病，咸能益阴，入血软坚，是以主之。甘能补中，故主伤中益气，肾足则水自上升，克与心交，故能养神也。二月三月采蒸之，当火炙用，否则，令人泻。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091710-w4l1w3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091710-w4l1w3n","updated":"20240611091710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸，治男子虚损肾衰，五脏气散，疝瘕阴痿，作中腰痛，精遗白浊，益精强用，补中固肾，通淋利水，复禁小便自遗，为梦遗方之要药。久服益气养神，益精生子，女子血闭腹痛，及胎前产后溺遗不禁。酒炒为末，白汤调服即止，故俗名禁尿窠，即螳螂子也。必以桑树上者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091656-g8e6b3v","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091656-g8e6b3v"}},{"ID":"20240611091657-2lsfkfa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091657-2lsfkfa","updated":"20240611091701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091657-2mrpekh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091657-2mrpekh","updated":"20240611091657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（卵生）滋肾利水交心"}]},{"ID":"20240611091657-jezaogj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091657-jezaogj","updated":"20240611091657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸（专入肝肾膀胱。）即桑枝上螳螂子也。一生九十九子。用一枚便伤百命。勿轻用之。禀秋金之阴气。得桑木之津液。味咸甘。气平无毒。入足少阴肾足太阳膀胱。盖人以肾为根本。男子肾经虚损。则五脏气微。或阴痿梦寐失精遗溺。螵蛸咸味属水。内舍于肾。肾得之而阴气生长。故能愈诸疾及益精生子。肾与膀胱为表里。肾得所养则膀胱自固。气化则能出。故利水道通淋也。（宗 治小便数。用桑螵蛸远志龙骨菖蒲人参茯神当归龟甲醋炙各一两为末。卧时人参汤调下而愈。）女子疝瘕血闭腰痛。皆肝肾二经为病。咸能入血软坚。是以主之。甘能补中。故主伤中益气。肾足则水自上升。克与心交。故能养神也。至书既言功专收涩。又言利便。（能涩能利。）义由是矣。产桑树者佳。（ 曰。杂树上生者名螺螺。宗曰。如无桑上者。即用他树者。以炙桑白皮佐之。桑白皮行水。以接螵蛸就肾经也。）酒炒用。畏旋复花。其子之母名螳螂。主治小儿惊搐。并出箭镞入肉。（时珍曰。古方风药。多用螵蛸。则螳螂治风。同一理也。又医林集要出箭镞。用螳螂一个。巴豆半个。同研敷伤处。微痒且忍。极痒乃撼拔之。以黄连贯众汤洗拭。锻石敷之。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091501-7ql9q9x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091501-7ql9q9x"}},{"ID":"20240611091643-r15t6vk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091643-r15t6vk","updated":"20240611091648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091643-th6fw1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091643-th6fw1k","updated":"20240611091643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经上品）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091643-9rhiwpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091643-9rhiwpp","updated":"20240611091643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出世人不肯作此用，世人亦无暇及此。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091643-ryn67yw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091643-ryn67yw","updated":"20240611091643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】咸甘平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091643-1oerwa6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091643-1oerwa6","updated":"20240611091643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主伤中，疝瘕，阴痿，益精生子。女子血闭，腰痛，通五淋，利小便水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091643-08n5xpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091643-08n5xpk","updated":"20240611091643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶桑螵蛸螳螂子也，深秋乳子作房，粘着桑枝上者，入药用。房长寸许，大如拇指，重重有隔房，每房有子如蛆卵，芒种节后，一齐都出。月令有云∶螳螂生也，螳螂骧首奋臂，修颈大腹，两手四足，善缘而捷，以须代鼻，喜食人发，尤善捕蝉。尔雅云∶不过螳螂，其子螵蛸，捕蝉而食，执木叶以自蔽，蝉将去而未飞，为之一前一却。庄子云∶螳螂执翳而搏之，得见而忘其形，盖谓是也。 云∶凡使勿用杂树枝上生者，名曰素螺。须觅桑枝东畔生者。采得，去核子，用沸浆水浸七次，锅中熬干用。别作修事无效也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091643-9etd0nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091643-9etd0nj","updated":"20240611091643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先人云∶房藏久远，一房百子，有肾之悭，得甲之体，候阴之物，输精之用者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091643-ybuspzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091643-ybuspzi","updated":"20240611091643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶桑螵蛸，即螳螂秋深产卵，连缀桑枝东畔者良。螵从票，蛸从肖，言劲疾轻举，肖类母性也。月令芒种螳螂生，盖是月升阴始起，杀虫应而生焉。不生是谓阴息，唯捕蝉时，有进退势，余只知进而已，当入厥阴，具厥阴体用者也。故主厥阴隐深之境，唯知厥退，为疝瘕阴痿，精涸血闭，五淋癃约，此不从升阴而起，反从降阴而息者。对待治之，倘阴杀自强，所当敛避，设不知却，欲仗怒臂以当车辙，恐亦不胜其任也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091522-7q8k311","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091522-7q8k311"}},{"ID":"20240611091633-57caai8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091633-57caai8","updated":"20240611091637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091633-tcuy63y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091633-tcuy63y","updated":"20240611091633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸甘。性平。无毒。禀秋金之阴气。兼得桑木之津液而成。能升能降。阴也。畏旋复花。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091633-nzbgwus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091633-nzbgwus","updated":"20240611091633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主伤中疝瘕。阴痿。益精生子。女子血闭腰痛。通五淋。利小便水道。（本经）疗男【归经】入肝命门膀胱三经。为固肾益精之品。（兼涩剂）【前论】苏颂曰。古方漏精。及风药中。多用之。寇氏曰。男女虚损。肾衰阴痿。梦遗白浊【炮制】韩保升曰。凡使。或炙黄。或醋煮。或酒炒。或汤泡煨用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091502-wd7jn8e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091502-wd7jn8e"}},{"ID":"20240611091508-qmila4b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-qmila4b","updated":"20240611091520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-c3p5smo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-c3p5smo","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【科属与药用部分】本品为螳螂科动物大刀螂等的卵块。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-br45v5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-br45v5w","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】甘、咸，平。入肝、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-2voffwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-2voffwp","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】补肾，固精，收缩小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-l0spw6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-l0spw6n","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于肾阳不足的遗精，滑精，小便频数，小便失禁及小儿遗尿等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-m82i2ld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-m82i2ld","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑螵蛸补肾助阳而偏于收涩，故有固精、收缩小便的功效。配菟丝子、枸杞子、补骨脂、龙骨、牡蛎等，可用于遗精、滑精；配覆盆子、益智仁、金樱子等，可用于尿频失禁及遗尿等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-wdg48fa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-wdg48fa","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】桑螵蛸（用麸皮炒微焦用）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-arx8gc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-arx8gc9","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】一钱至三钱，煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-5mchozv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-5mchozv","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【按语】桑螵蛸补肝肾，助阳固精，能治肾虚阳痿、遗精、尿频失禁、遗尿等症；也可用于头晕、腰酸及带下等症。总的说来，补肾收涩，是它主要的效用。如属阴虚火旺或内有湿热的遗精、尿频，不宜应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-296ysj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-296ysj1","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】桑螵蛸散《本草衍义》：桑膘娟、远志、龙骨、石菖蒲、人参、茯苓、龟板、当归。治小便频数及遗尿、失精等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-oxohvcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-oxohvcb","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「主阴痿，益精....女子血闭腰痛，通五淋，利小便水道。」"}]},{"ID":"20240611091508-6ubyhqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091508-6ubyhqn","updated":"20240611091508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《别录》：「疗男子虚损，五脏气微，梦寐失精，遗溺。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091439-sdbdrxj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091439-sdbdrxj"}},{"ID":"20240611091446-tnxw9j1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-tnxw9j1","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：桑螵蛸"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ve1sxb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ve1sxb8","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-t659ytn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-t659ytn","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Sānɡ Piāo Shāo"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-benja1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-benja1r","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ntq07el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ntq07el","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 团螵蛸、长螵蛸、黑螵蛸、螳螂巢、螳螂子、刀螂子、螳螂蛋、流尿狗"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-g67auuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-g67auuq","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-7omvr4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-7omvr4e","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" OOTHECA MANTIDIS"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-d7m3umq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-d7m3umq","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-7nhsfsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-7nhsfsx","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为螳螂科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大刀螂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tenodera sinensis Saussure 、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小刀螂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Statilia maculata （Thunberg）或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"巨斧螳螂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hierodula patellifera （Serville）的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"卵鞘"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。以上三种分别习称“团螵蛸”、“长螵蛸”及“黑螵蛸”。深秋至次春采收，除去杂质，蒸至虫卵死后，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-beyrg9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-beyrg9m","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-7kbti1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-7kbti1o","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 团螵蛸：略呈圆柱形或半圆形，由多层膜状薄片叠成，长2.5～4cm，宽2～3cm。表面浅黄褐色，上面带状隆起不明显，底面平坦或有凹沟。体轻，质松而韧，横断面可见外层为海绵状，内层为许多放射状排列的小室，室内各有一细小椭圆形卵，深棕色，有光泽。气微腥，味淡或微咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-7zsijd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-7zsijd0","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长螵蛸：略呈长条形，一端较细，长2.5～5cm，宽1～1.5cm。表面灰黄色，上面带状隆起明显，带的两侧各有一条暗棕色浅沟及斜向纹理。质硬而脆。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-6sumhd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-6sumhd4","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黑螵蛸：略呈平行四边形，长2～4cm，宽1.5～2cm。表面灰褐色，上面带状隆起明显，两侧有斜向纹理，近尾端微向上翘。质硬而韧。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-yn4za6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-yn4za6p","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-84nmam2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-84nmam2","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ek9vb05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ek9vb05","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-juiu297","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-juiu297","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除去杂质，蒸透，干燥。用时剪碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-1deodr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-1deodr9","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-iknyo2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-iknyo2p","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-qcjwk5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-qcjwk5e","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ertyfx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ertyfx4","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘、咸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-pr6h1ry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-pr6h1ry","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-95ldrad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-95ldrad","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 益肾固精，缩尿，止浊。用于遗精滑精，遗尿尿频，小便白浊。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ljmxdh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ljmxdh9","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-t8wqtvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-t8wqtvb","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 5～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-6hx5x7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-6hx5x7u","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-x52rjov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-x52rjov","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ytrld2k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ytrld2k","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：桑螵蛸"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-b1euouo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-b1euouo","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-dlk2uqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-dlk2uqs","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Sānɡ Piāo Shāo"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-3ejdrpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-3ejdrpw","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-fz0cgy0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-fz0cgy0","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜱蛸（《尔雅》），桑蛸（《吴普本草》），冒焦、螵蛸（《广雅》），致神、螳螂子（《别录》），桑上螳螂窠（《伤寒总病论》），赖尿郎（《本草便读》），刀螂子（《河北药材》），螳螂蛋、尿唧唧（《山东中药》），流尿狗（《中药志》），猴儿包（《四川中药志》），螳螂壳（《江苏药材志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-prokd6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-prokd6k","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-bxctrqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-bxctrqa","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-kf1fl6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-kf1fl6l","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-h30rxfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-h30rxfa","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为螳螂科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大刀螂、小刀螂、薄翅螳螂、巨斧螳螂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"华北刀螂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"卵鞘"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。自深秋至翌年春季均可采收，采得后，除去树枝，置蒸笼内蒸30～40分钟，杀死虫卵，晒干或烤干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ppwbarq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ppwbarq","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-qvxpsh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-qvxpsh0","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 详\"螳螂\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-hek87jl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-hek87jl","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-j1b67dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-j1b67dv","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 因形状不同，分为下列三种："}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-bgxy6an","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-bgxy6an","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①团螵蛸"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-j4vuhxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-j4vuhxi","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：软螵蛸、元螵蛸。略呈圆柱形或者类圆形，长2.5～4厘米，宽2～3厘米，由多数膜状薄层叠成，表面浅黄褐色或黄褐色，上面有不很明显的隆起带，底面平坦或有附着在植物茎上而形成的凹沟。体轻，质松，有韧性。断面可见许多放射状排列的小室，室内各有一细小椭圆形的卵，呈黄棕色，有光泽。气微腥，味微咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-xunrbyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-xunrbyl","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产广西、云南、湖北、湖南、河北、辽宁。此外，河南、山东、江苏、内蒙古、四川等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-7kbd9n4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-7kbd9n4","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②长螵蛸"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-1q9pj4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-1q9pj4a","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：硬螵蛸。略呈长条形，长2.5～5厘米，厚约1厘米。一端较短，一端较细而长。表面灰黄色，有斜向纹理。上面呈凸面状，上有带状隆起，隆起带两侧各有一浅沟，呈褐色或灰褐色，底面平坦或凹入，有时可见树皮附着于底部。质坚而脆。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-dli55rq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-dli55rq","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产浙江、江苏、安徽、山东、湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-a0di5j3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-a0di5j3","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③黑螵蛸"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-kxy7yph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-kxy7yph","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"略呈平行四边形，长2～3.5厘米，宽1～1.5匣米，厚1～1.5厘米。表面褐色，有斜向纹理，上面呈凸面状，并有带状隆起，近尾端微向上翘，质坚而韧。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-z00ptkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-z00ptkg","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产河北、山东、河南、山西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-61zu7uz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-61zu7uz","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上均以干燥、完整、幼虫未出，色黄、体轻而带韧性，无树枝草梗等杂质为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-pz8qnf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-pz8qnf0","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-fay303l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-fay303l","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含蛋白质及脂肪等。卵囊附着的蛋白质膜上，含柠檬酸钙（六分子结晶水）的结晶。卵黄球含糖蛋白及脂蛋白。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-3w9wxei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-3w9wxei","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-zjgtiio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-zjgtiio","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 炒桑螵蛸：将净螵蛸和麸皮同炒至老黄色，取出筛去麸皮，放凉即可。盐炒桑螵蛸：取净螵蛸，用盐水拌匀，稍闷，入锅炒至微黄，取出晾干。（每桑螵蛸10斤，用盐5两，加水适量溶化）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ylk9ei7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ylk9ei7","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮炙论》：\"采得，去核子，用沸浆水浸淘七遍，令水遍沸，于磁锅中熬令干用，勿乱别修事，却无效也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-t4wu16m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-t4wu16m","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"桑螵蛸当火炙，不尔令人泄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-r35bdm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-r35bdm1","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《蜀本草》：\"《图经》云：以热浆水浸一伏时，焙干，于柳木灰中炮令黄色用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-sh5f0r6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-sh5f0r6","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-r2ogyil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-r2ogyil","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-4yjoxta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-4yjoxta","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"肝、肾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-plq69j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-plq69j6","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入足少阴、太阳经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ram9k77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ram9k77","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-z6rxqzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-z6rxqzz","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-je3ynol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-je3ynol","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-sg5lkq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-sg5lkq9","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"神农：咸，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-1n57aay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-1n57aay","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"甘，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-txurqgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-txurqgn","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-g1rgkft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-g1rgkft","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 阴虚火旺或膀胱有热者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-0lgcu6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-0lgcu6n","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"得龙骨治泄精。畏旋复花。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ok93k9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ok93k9y","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"畏戴椹。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-vhnofml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-vhnofml","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"凡失精遗溺，火气太盛者宜少少用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-oo9ek30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-oo9ek30","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本经逢原》：\"阴虚多火人误用，反助虚阳，多致溲赤茎痛，强中失精，不可不知。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-c8nh59p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-c8nh59p","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-azwpg94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-azwpg94","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肾，固精。治遗精，白浊，小便频数，遗尿，赤白带下，阳痿，早泄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ilnl62z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ilnl62z","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主伤中，疝瘕，阴痿，益精生子。女子血闭腰痛，通五淋，利小便水道。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-inssfjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-inssfjc","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗男子虚损，五藏气微，梦寐失精，遗溺。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-vxn0tfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-vxn0tfs","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"主男子肾衰漏精，精自出，患虚冷者能止之。止小便利，火炮令热，空心食之。虚而小便利，加而用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-4i1b6rn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-4i1b6rn","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草衍义》：\"治小便白浊。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-x4c7473","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-x4c7473","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《玉楸药解》：\"治带浊淋漓，耳痛，喉痹，瘕疝，骨鲠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-pwfpu2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-pwfpu2f","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-eiclj3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-eiclj3v","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-3008306","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-3008306","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ojsu608","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ojsu608","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治遗精白浊，盗汗虚劳：桑螵蛸（炙）、白龙骨等分。为细末。每服二钱，空心用盐汤送下。（《外台》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-m9948rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-m9948rl","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②安神魂，定心志，治健忘，小便数，补心气：桑螵蛸、远志、菖蒲、龙骨、人参、茯神、当归、龟甲（醋炙）各一两。为末。夜卧，人参汤调下二钱。（《本草衍久》桑螵蛸散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-siu61bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-siu61bt","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治妊娠小便数不禁：桑螵蛸十二枚。捣为散。分作两服，米饮下。（《产书方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-s5zo5a3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-s5zo5a3","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治小便不通及胞转：桑螵蛸捣末，米饮服方寸匕，日三。（《产书方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-qbv5wpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-qbv5wpu","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治产后遗尿或尿数：桑螵蛸（炙）半两，龙骨一两。为末。每米饮服二钱。（《徐氏胎产方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-2n0e1ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-2n0e1ml","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治男妇疝瘕作痛：桑螵蛸一两，小茴香一两二钱。共为末。每服二钱，花椒汤调服。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-dkmv6ew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-dkmv6ew","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治咽喉骨鲠：桑螵蛸，醋煎呷之。（《经验良方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-0fdqgx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-0fdqgx4","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治底耳：桑螵蛸一个。慢火炙及八分熟，存性，细研，入麝香一字，为末，掺在耳内，每用半字。如有脓，先用绵包子拈去，次后掺药末，入在耳内。（《经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-9jeaxgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-9jeaxgl","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治小儿软疖：桑螵蛸炉存性，研末，油调敷之。（《世医得效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-jmn19lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-jmn19lf","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-wj1dfv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-wj1dfv2","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗遗尿症:取桑螵蛸、益智仁各1.5两（5～12岁儿童用1两），水煎，日服1剂。试治11例，一般连服3～4剂即可见效，再服2～3剂，可巩固疗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-bn14y15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-bn14y15","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-5xhnxkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-5xhnxkz","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经逢原》：\"桑螵蛸，肝肾命门药也。功专收涩，故男子虚损，肾虚阳痿，梦中失精，遗溺白浊方多用之。《本经》又言通五淋，利小便水道，盖取以泄下焦虚滞也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-fla9gol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-fla9gol","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-gycudpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-gycudpw","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-tmwndwa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-tmwndwa","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：桑螵蛸"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-m6t7nqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-m6t7nqs","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-axdqj70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-axdqj70","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Sānɡ Piāo Shāo"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-1025fl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-1025fl2","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-cjsay3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-cjsay3q","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜱蛸、 桑蛸、冒焦、螵蛸、致神、螳螂子、桑上螳螂窠、野狐鼻涕、赖尿郎、刀螂子、老鸹芯脐、螳螂蛋、尿唧唧、流尿狗、猴儿包、螳螂壳"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-zgk4ie6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-zgk4ie6","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ggy0xhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ggy0xhs","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Mantis Egg-case"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-61o4pjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-61o4pjo","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-7180mx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-7180mx6","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》陶弘景：桑螵蛸，以桑上者为好，是兼得桑皮之津气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-63hc50a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-63hc50a","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-jp1zoml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-jp1zoml","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为螳螂科动物大刀螂、南方刀螂、广腹螳螂的卵鞘。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-1rh1pou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-1rh1pou","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Paratenodera sinensis Saussure2.Tenodera aridifolia Stoll.3.Stalilia maculata Thunb4.Hierodula patellifera Serville"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-6kl5iea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-6kl5iea","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：每年秋季至翌年春季在树上采集卵鞘，蒸30-40min，以杀死其中虫卵，晒干或烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-1csmzmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-1csmzmf","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-fp6376d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-fp6376d","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.栖于草丛及树枝上。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-yuz31wg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-yuz31wg","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2多栖于向阳背风的灌木、矮小丛及草丛茺地处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-bjdf76y","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-bjdf76y","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611091446-g4p76aq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-g4p76aq","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611091446-ecsyvga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ecsyvga","updated":"20240611091446"}}]}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-fyblqk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-fyblqk4","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.全国大部分地区均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-0iiloz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-0iiloz3","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于南方各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-eal8507","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-eal8507","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.全国大部分地区均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-78936st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-78936st","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.分布于我国广东、台湾和湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-wz2e0xx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-wz2e0xx","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-88vhu5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-88vhu5j","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.大刀螂，体形较大，长约8cm。黄褐色或绿色，头三角形，前胸背后板、肩部较发达，后部至前肢基部稍宽。前胸细长。前翅革质，前缘带绿色，末端的较明显的褐色翅脉；后翅比前翅稍长，有深浅不等的黑褐色斑点散布其间。雌虫腹部特别膨大。足3对前胸足粗大，，镰刀状。中足和后足细长。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-mjy54qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-mjy54qs","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.南方刀螂，体中等大小，细长，体绿色、黄褐色或浅灰褐色。头三角形，触角丝状，复眼大而突出，单眼3个，红棕色，呈“品”字形排列，前胸长，前胸背板两侧几平行，中间有一浅纵沟。翅淡绿色、黄褐色或浅灰褐色，半透明。前足腿节三角形，两前足基部中央有一明显的橘红色斑纹。中足和后足细长。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-v53rh8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-v53rh8i","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.小刀螂，体中等大小，长4.8-6.5cm，色灰褐色至暗褐色，有黑褐色不规则的刻点散布其间。头部稍大，呈三角形。前胸背细长，侧缘细齿排列明显。侧角部的齿稍特殊。前翅革质，末端钝圆，带黄褐色或红褐色，有污黄色斑点。后翅翅脉为暗褐色。前胸足腿节内侧基部及胫节内侧中部各有一大形黑色斑纹。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-cqc9pn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-cqc9pn1","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.文腹螳螂，体中等大小，绿色。头三角形，触角丝状。复眼发达，单眼3个。前胸粗短，前半部两侧扩大，最大宽度为最狭处的2倍。两侧有明显的小齿。前翅革质，狭长如叶片状，外缘及基部青绿色，中部透明，外缘中间有淡黄色斑块；后翅膜质。前中镰刀状，前足基节下缘有4个齿。中足和后足细长"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-e0unhrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-e0unhrf","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-g0xvbyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-g0xvbyn","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别（1）团螵蛸略呈圆柱形或半圆形，由多数膜状薄层叠成，长2.5-4cm，宽2-3cm。表面浅黄褐色，上面带状隆起不明显，底而平坦或有凹沟。体轻，质松而韧。横断面可见外层为海绵状，内层为许多放射状排列的小室，室内各有一细小椭圆形卵，深棕色，有光泽。气微腥，味淡或微咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-198eoel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-198eoel","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）长螵蛸，略呈长条形，一端较细，长2.5-5cm，宽1-1.5cm。表面灰黄色，上面带状隆起明显，带有两侧各有一条暗棕色浅沟及斜向纹理。质硬而脆。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-4kdimn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-4kdimn7","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）黑螵蛸，略呈平行四边形，长2-4cm，宽1.5-2cm。表面灰褐色，上面带状隆起明显，两侧有斜向纹理，近尾端微向上翘。质硬而韧。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-hoybzo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-hoybzo6","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"均以干燥、完整、幼虫未出，色黄、体轻而带韧性，无树枝草梗等杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-2f1tolp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-2f1tolp","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-mhgzouc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-mhgzouc","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.广腹螳螂，桑螵蛸（干燥卵鞘）含 蛋白质、脂肪、枸橼酸钙（6分分子结晶水）。卵黄球含糖蛋白（glycoprotein）及脂蛋白（lipoprotein）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-lq2ujcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-lq2ujcb","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黑螵带卵内层平均含氮11.25%，不带卵外层平均含氮14.50%。左粘胶腺（left colleterial gland）含原儿茶酸（procatechuic acid）的甙。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-cerofyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-cerofyt","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.薄翅螳螂，桑螵蛸含蛋白质、脂肪。卵黄球含糖蛋白及脂蛋白。全虫棕色素与黄色素为胆绿及其相类物质。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-zyclf2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-zyclf2c","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.华北刀螂，桑螵蛸含蛋白质58.5%，脂肪 11.95%，糖1.6%，还含粗纤维20.16%，水分2.81%，钙0.4%，铁，胡萝卜素样色素。团螵蛸带内层平均含氮10.53%，不带卵外层含氮13.09%。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-p5swrum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-p5swrum","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.长螳螂，桑螵蛸含蛋白南、脂肪、碳水化合物、粗纤维及铁、钙、胡萝卜素样色素。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-3ie5ntc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-3ie5ntc","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.小刀螂，桑螵蛸含蛋白质、脂肪及粗纤维等。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-nub5z1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-nub5z1o","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-i698jrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-i698jrf","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.桑螵蛸《本草经集注》：“当破之。”《普济方》：“中劈破，研为细末”《医学入门：“热水浸淘七次。”《本草能玄》：“浆水浸一日。”现行，取原药材，除去杂质，置蒸具骨蒸约1h，取出干燥。蒸制品可消除生口致泻作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-l3mdebt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-l3mdebt","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.炒桑螵蛸《雷公炮炙论》：“凡采得，去核子，用沸浆水浸淘七扁，令水遍沸，于瓷锅中熬令干用。”《外台》：“炒。”《圣惠方》：“微炒”，“炒令黄。”现行，取净桑螵蛸，置锅内，用文火加热，炒至棕黄色具有焦斑，取出，放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-e64jv1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-e64jv1m","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.盐桑螵蛸《普济方》：“盐水炒。”现行，取净桑螵蛸，加入盐水拌匀，闷润后置锅内，用文火加热，炒至有香气逸出时，取出放凉。每桑螵蛸100gk，用食盐2.5kg。盐桑螵蛸可增强益肾固粗作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-h3qaoar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-h3qaoar","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.酒桑螵蛸《局方》：“酒浸炒。”《严氏济生方》：“酒浸。”《普济方》：“酒浸炙。”现行，取蒸过的净难能可桑螵蛸，用酒喷洒均匀，微润，置锅内用文火加热，炒至微干，取出放凉。每次桑螵蛸100kg，用黄酒10kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ijhycsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ijhycsh","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-pgotgd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-pgotgd0","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；肾；膀胱经"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-j15xafm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-j15xafm","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-hj8hghv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-hj8hghv","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味甘；咸；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-i7ziiuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-i7ziiuy","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-ka61guy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-ka61guy","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 阴虚火旺或膀胱有热者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-t3pjohw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-t3pjohw","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草经集注》：得龙骨治泄精。畏旋复花。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-xowb15u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-xowb15u","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《药性论》：畏戴椹。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-zkv3w37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-zkv3w37","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草经疏》：凡失精通溺，火气太盛者宜少少用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-igob5ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-igob5ck","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本经逢原》：阴虚多火人误用，反助虚阳，多致浸赤茎痛，强中失精，不可不知。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-otjhj4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-otjhj4z","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-t59jgou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-t59jgou","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 固精缩尿；补肾助阳。主遗精；早泄；阳痿；遗尿；尿频；小便失禁；白浊；带下"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-mgdfw6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-mgdfw6l","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-0ws8k7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-0ws8k7b","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，5-10g；研末，3-5g；或入丸剂。外用：适量，研末撒或油调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-yp977pv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-yp977pv","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-1tlkzui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-1tlkzui","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治遗精自浊，盗汗虚劳： 桑螵蛸(炙)、白龙骨等分。为细末。每服二钱，空心用盐汤送下。 (《外台》)②安神魂，定心志，治健忘，小便数，补心气： 桑螵蛸、远志、菖蒲、龙骨、人参、获神、当归、龟甲(醋炙)各一两。 为末。夜卧，人参汤调下二钱。 (《本草衍义》桑膘销散)③治妊娠小便数不禁： 桑膘峭十二枚。捣为散。分作两服，米钦下。(《产书方》④治小便不通及胞转： 桑螵蛸捣末，米饮服方寸匕，日三。(《产书方》)⑤治产后遗尿或尿数 桑螵蛸(炙)半两， 龙骨一两。为末。每米饮服二钱。 (《徐氏胎产方》)⑥治男妇疝瘕作痛： 桑螵蛸一两，小茴香一两二钱。共为末。每服二钱，花椒汤调服。(《本草汇言》)⑦治咽喉骨鲠： 桑螵蛸，醋煎呷之。(《经验良方》)⑧治底耳： 桑螵蛸一个。慢火炙及八分熟，存性，细研，入麝香一字，为末。掺在耳内，每用半字。如有脓，先用绵包子拈去，次后掺药末，入在耳内。(《经验方》)⑨治小儿软疖： 桑螵蛸烧存性，研木，油调敷之。(《世医得效方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-nhkiae1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-nhkiae1","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-9t77rcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-9t77rcc","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗遗尿症。取桑螵蛸、益智仁各1.5两(5-12岁儿童用1两)，水煎，日服1剂。试治 11例，一般连服3-4剂即可见效，再服2-3剂，可巩固疗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-7dmr0oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-7dmr0oy","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-fru4jrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-fru4jrh","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经逢原》：桑螵蛸，肝肾命门药也。功专收涩；故男子虚损，肾虚阳痿，梦中失精，遗溺白浊方多用之。《本经》又言通五淋，利小便水道，盖取以泄下焦虚滞也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-h0q6cga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-h0q6cga","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经》：主伤中，疝瘕，阴痿，益精生子。女子血闭腰痛，通五琳，利小便水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-5hoiebe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-5hoiebe","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《别录》：疗男子虚损，五藏气微，梦寐失精，遗溺。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-cj0d0t2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-cj0d0t2","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《药性论》：主男子肾衰漏精，精自出，患虚冷者能止之。止小便利，火炮令热，空心食之。虚而小便利，加而用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-arxhasw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-arxhasw","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草衍义》：治小便白浊。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-srlb12w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-srlb12w","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《玉揪药解》：治带浊淋漓，耳痛，喉痹，瘕疝，骨鲠。"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-mxovwju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-mxovwju","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611091446-m4jk58u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091446-m4jk58u","updated":"20240611091446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611091447-z6clj1t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611091447-z6clj1t"}},{"ID":"20240611091448-fmxhcj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611091448-fmxhcj4"}}]}